  "term": "fabrication",
  "definition": "In this context, fabrication refers to a situation where someone other than the patient makes up illness symptoms, leading to unnecessary and often painful medical tests or treatment. The source describes this as a form of child abuse, usually involving a parent presenting a child for care based on invented symptoms.",
